    {
      "id": 90,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "GitHub Actions（main）",
      "description": "遠端 CI。2026-08-31 之前它的狀態不在任何板面、也不在任何告警上——最近 20 次有 13 次紅、至少六天沒人知道。紅了不被告知，和沒紅是一樣的。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 20,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093"
          },
          "expr": "devops_node_state_code{node=\"gha\"}",
          "legendFormat": "gha",
          "refId": "A"
